..!interpreter english translate noabbrev
..*****************************************************************************
.. Name           : ARCHIV.EV
.. Autor          : kop
.. Verantwortlich : teamreport
.. Kontrolle      : mg
.. Funktion       : Behandelt die Ereignisse der Eingabefelder ausser denen des
.. Startbuttons.
.. Ablauf         : Zentrales EFOP
..
.. Functionality  : Handles the events of the input fields except those of the
.. startbutton.
.. Program flow   : Central efop
..*****************************************************************************
.set trans -
..------------------------------- Header -------------------------------------
.continue LAYOUT ? G|evtartengl = "FIELD_EXIT"    & G|evtvar = "layout"
..----------------------------------------------------------------------------
.continue END
..
!LAYOUT
.input "is/TABLEEREN"
.copy M|archiv = M|layout^archiv
.copy M|archivpfl = M|layout^archivpfl
..*****************************************************************************
!END
.continue
